# Senda de Campeones, floor 1 (C9, contract 56), 28 x 22. column = i, row = j. A CAVE (@cave yes). The cave mouth of Ruta 23 arrives at the SOUTH edge (13..14, 21); the way on is the north corridor (13, 9..12), shut by a
# GATE OF ROCKS (13,11): the boulder of the west chamber (4,16) must be pushed east along row 16 (4 pushes, Empuje) into the pit (8,16): that sets the pit's flag, and the step trigger (13,12) crumbles the gate. The north hall holds the ladder up
# (21,3), an elite trainer at the corridor's mouth and an item; the east alcove (20..26,12..19) holds a karateka and an item. Look: the user's approved SENDA scene (tools/c9_mock.py): LIGHT worn rock with sparse grit, crystal-vein cubes on the back
# sides, torches, the cave floor is the encounter ground.
@map senda_1
@size 28 22
@interior no
@cave yes
@area senda_campeones
@bg 0
@fill rockg
@spawn south 13 20 N
@spawn from_2 21 4 S
@flag senda_pit1 906                  # the pit of floor 1 (a boulder filled it)
@flag senda1_open 909                  # the gate of floor 1 opened (set by the step trigger once the pit is filled)
@flag beaten_elite_s1a 916
@flag beaten_karateka_s1b 917
@encounters grass rate=14
  tuskid 40 44 5
  tuskmash 43 46 15
  cragodile 40 44 10
  echowing 42 46 20
  rockroll 42 46 5
  dashmark 43 46 10
  bouldrum 44 47 25
  kickaroo 42 45 10
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass area=,. period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=rockg
  ,  tile=rockf
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=srubble
  _  tile=none
  f  tile=rockg object=torch
  a  tile=rockg object=stalag_a
  b  tile=rockg boulder=yes
  h  tile=rockg hole=senda_pit1
  G  tile=rockg npc=rock_gate id=gate1 face=S solid=yes gate=yes hide_flag=senda1_open text=sd.gate
  t  tile=rockf interact=step script=gate1_check
  L  tile=rockf door=rope_ladder
  n  tile=rockf
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=ultra_cristal
  k  item=ward_spray
  l  item=vit_spc
  A  tile=rockg npc=elite_s id=elite_s1a face=SW trainer=elite_s1a range=3 text=tr.elite_s1a.pre after=tr.elite_s1a.after beaten_flag=beaten_elite_s1a
  B  tile=rockg npc=karateka_s id=karateka_s1b face=NW trainer=karateka_s1b range=4 text=tr.karateka_s1b.pre after=tr.karateka_s1b.after beaten_flag=beaten_karateka_s1b
  c  tile=rockg item=disc_44
  H  tile=rockg hidden=vital_draught   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ____________________________
  ____WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW_____
  ____Wf........a.......fr____
  ____W................L.r____
  ____W..................r____
  ____W........A.......k.r____
  ____W..................r____
  ____W.i................r____
  ____W.....a............r____
  _____rrrrrrrW.rrrrrrrrr_____
  ____________W.r_____________
  _WWWWWWW____WGr____WWWWWWWW_
  _W....a.WWWWWtWWWWWW.....Har
  _W......W.........cW.......r
  _W......Wf........fW.......r
  _W......W..........W.......r
  _W..b...h...............B..r
  _W......W..................r
  _W......W..........W......jr
  _W.....aW....,,....Wa......r
  __rrrrrrW....,,....rrrrrrrr_
  _________rrrWnnrrrr_________
@warp n -> ruta_23 spawn=north
@warp L -> senda_2 spawn=from_1
# The gate of floor 1 (the Senda's switch, Senda de Campeones boulder switches): a boulder pushed onto the pit fills it (flag senda_pit1, engine); the step trigger in front of the gate opens it the moment the hero
# stands there (a wall of rocks that crumbles); the gate's own hide flag keeps it open for good.
@script gate1_check step if senda_pit1
    jf senda1_open done
    sfx door
    npc_hide gate1
    setf senda1_open
  done:
    end
@end
